g what you were fiddling with.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_13","text":"Do you intend on using that to request an emergency evac?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"massproduction01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_14","text":"That's right. Unlike you... time is not on my side.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_15","text":"And we have all the time in the world. That's why we didn't call it in. Is that what you really think?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"massproduction01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_16","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_17","text":"If you have so little faith in us, do it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"massproduction01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_18","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_19","text":"Call it in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_20","text":"If you use Blabla, you can send Syuen a message anonymously.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"massproduction01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_21","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_22","text":"Um, Maxwell... don't I have a say in this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_23","text":"Well? Too scared to go through with it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"massproduction01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_24","text":"You think I won't do it? I'll show you!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_25","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_25","text":"The mass-produced Nikke opens Laplace's Blabla.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"massproduction01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_26","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_27","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_28","text":"Now, do you believe me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_fairytalesend_if","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"massproduction01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_29","text":"I can't believe it...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_30","text":"Don't act so shocked. I'm sure this isn't the first time you've seen Syuen act like this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"massproduction01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_31","text":"But you're Matis...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_32","text":"And? What's so special about us? You just saw how she treats us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_33","text":"If we don't complete our mission, she'll have us replaced.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"massproduction01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_34","text":"But Syuen always seemed so kind to Matis. She never calls you scrap metal or anything like that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_35","text":"True. She doesn't call us names. We're her favorites.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_36","text":"But so what? We may be Matis, but that doesn't make us human.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"massproduction01","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_37","text":"...!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_38","text":"Don't get it twisted.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_39","text":"No matter how good you are, you're still a Nikke.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_40","text":"We may be top-of-the-line toys, but that's exactly what we are: toys.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_41","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_41","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_42","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_42","text":"Maxwell takes Laplace's cellphone from the mass-produced Nikkes hand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_43","text":"Now then, if there aren't any more questions, can we focus our attention elsewhere?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_hightechtoy_05_e_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_w","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_hightechtoy_05_e_44","text":"You said you don't have time. If you want to save your friends, we have to hurry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affini